@baseUrl = https://license.example.invalid
@organizationId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@token = replace-with-delegated-api-token

### Load saved evidence only (ViewInventory + ViewFindings; exact bound account required)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/cloud-activity?provider=Aws&accountId=123456789012
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Idempotent snapshot upload (RunScan + ViewInventory + ViewFindings)
# Example timestamps only: Desktop generates the current 90-day window after explicit live-read consent.
# Repeating the same ID and evidence is safe; changing evidence under an existing ID returns 409.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/cloud-activity
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "snapshotId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "provider": 1,
  "accountId": "123456789012",
  "fromUtc": "2026-08-10T12:00:00Z",
  "throughUtc": "2026-11-08T12:00:00Z",
  "source": "CloudTrail regional event history",
  "coverageDetails": "Partial: regional management events only.",
  "truncated": false,
  "events": [
    {
      "eventId": "source-event-id",
      "principal": "arn:aws:iam::123456789012:user/example",
      "action": "iam.amazonaws.com/CreateUser",
      "permissionAction": null,
      "resource": null,
      "timestamp": "2026-11-07T12:00:00Z",
      "success": true
    }
  ]
}

### No stored snapshot for a bound account returns 404; an unbound account is forbidden
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/cloud-activity?provider=Gcp&accountId=client-project
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
